Design:
```rust
/// Record one processed album's counters for a label run.
///
/// A failure that `process_album` reports as an outcome is counted the same as
/// one returned as an error: the summary's "M failed" must match the report's
/// Failed section whichever route the album took.
fn count_label_outcome(counters: &mut label_discover::LabelCounters, outcome: &AlbumOutcome) {
    match outcome {
        AlbumOutcome::Downloaded { destination: DownloadDestination::Staging(_), .. } => {
            counters.staged_albums += 1;
        }
        AlbumOutcome::Downloaded { .. } => {}
        AlbumOutcome::Failed { .. } | AlbumOutcome::NoCandidates { .. } => {
            counters.failed_albums += 1;
        }
        AlbumOutcome::Skipped => {}
    }
}
```
Then Ok arm: `count_label_outcome(&mut counters, &outcome);` and Err arm: keep `counters.failed_albums += 1;` (no AlbumOutcome there — could construct Failed and pass, but simpler to increment).

